{
  "uid": "redis-soak",
  "title": "Redis operator soak",
  "description": "The redis-operator soak tester's probes, invariants, mutations, chaos actions and data.",
  "tags": [
    "redis",
    "redis-operator",
    "soak"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "label": "Data source",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "refresh": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "rf",
        "type": "query",
        "label": "Instance",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "description": "The RedisFailover. Its series carry its configured mode, not its current one.",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(redis_soak_rf_healthy, rf)",
          "refId": "rf"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(redis_soak_rf_healthy, rf)",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "Chaos",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "orange",
        "expr": "max by (kind) (redis_soak_chaos_in_progress) == 1",
        "titleFormat": "{{kind}}",
        "step": "15s"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Chaos, findings and build",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Reading this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 9
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "One row per instance (`rf`), repeated from the variable, after this global row.\n\n* **Paths**: `sentinel` through the Sentinels, `rfrm` the master Service, `rfrs` the replica Service of a bootstrapping (read-only) instance.\n* **Clients**: `pooled` (an application), `retrying` (default go-redis retries), `fresh` (a new connection per probe), `follower` (pooled, but takes a changed password at once: its `auth` outages are the operator's delay).\n* **mode** is the instance's configured mode, not its current one: series stay the same when `sentinel_toggle` switches it.\n* **window**: while a mutation, a chaos action or a spec change converges, violations are expected. A violation outside a window is a **finding**.\n* Outages and lost writes are labelled with the **event** that ran: a chaos kind, the instance's mutation kind, `failover`, `periodic`, `reset` or `none`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Build",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "redis_soak_build_info",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      },
      "description": "The operator version is its Deployment's image tag.",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Findings in range",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 14,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 10,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (rf, invariant) (increase(redis_soak_findings_total[$__range])) > 0",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      },
      "description": "Invariant violations outside a convergence window, or past its timeout. Should be empty.",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Windows open",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 3,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(redis_soak_window_open)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "open",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value"
      },
      "description": "Instances whose convergence window is open now."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Invariants violated",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 11,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 3,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "count(redis_soak_invariant_ok == 0) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "violated",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value"
      },
      "description": "Invariants violated now, in or outside a window."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Chaos in progress",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "redis_soak_chaos_in_progress",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{kind}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "no",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "yes",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showValue": "never",
        "mergeValues": true,
        "rowHeight": 0.8,
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false
        }
      },
      "description": "1 while a chaos action runs: every mutator is paused and every instance is in a window."
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Chaos actions in range",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (kind, result) (increase(redis_soak_chaos_total[$__range]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      },
      "description": "converged, timeout (the operator or an instance didn't converge, or a budget blocked an eviction), failed (an API call or helm failed) or skipped.",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Chaos convergence (seconds)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (kind) (increase(redis_soak_chaos_converge_seconds_sum[$__range])) / sum by (kind) (increase(redis_soak_chaos_converge_seconds_count[$__range]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "mean",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (kind, le) (increase(redis_soak_chaos_converge_seconds_bucket[$__range])))",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (kind) (increase(redis_soak_chaos_operator_down_seconds_sum[$__range])) / sum by (kind) (increase(redis_soak_chaos_operator_down_seconds_count[$__range]))",
          "refId": "C",
          "legendFormat": "operator down, mean",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      },
      "description": "From a restart's delete, each upgrade's helm upgrade, or a drain's cordon, until every instance converged. Operator down: from the old leader's deletion until a new one held the Lease.",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Evictions a PodDisruptionBudget blocked",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(redis_soak_chaos_eviction_blocked_seconds_count[$__rate_interval]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "blocked evictions",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(redis_soak_chaos_eviction_blocked_seconds_sum[$__rate_interval]))",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "seconds blocked",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "description": "Drain evictions a budget refused, and for how long, until it let them or the drain timed out."
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Lost writes by chaos kind in range",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (rf, event) (increase(redis_soak_lost_writes_total{event=~\"operator_restart|operator_upgrade|node_drain\"}[$__range]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      },
      "description": "Acknowledged writes missing after each chaos action, per instance. Every chaos action should lose none.",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Outages by chaos kind in range",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 22,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (rf, event) (increase(redis_soak_outage_duration_seconds_count{event=~\"operator_restart|operator_upgrade|node_drain\"}[$__range]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "outages",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (rf, event) (increase(redis_soak_outage_duration_seconds_sum{event=~\"operator_restart|operator_upgrade|node_drain\"}[$__range]))",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "seconds",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      },
      "description": "Outages that started while a chaos action ran, over every path and client style.",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "$rf",
      "collapsed": false,
      "repeat": "rf",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Writable",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 29,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "redis_soak_writable{rf=\"$rf\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{path}} {{client}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "no",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "yes",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showValue": "never",
        "mergeValues": true,
        "rowHeight": 0.8,
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false
        }
      },
      "description": "Whether the last write probe succeeded, per path and client style."
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Readable",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 29,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "redis_soak_readable{rf=\"$rf\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{path}} {{client}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "no",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "yes",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showValue": "never",
        "mergeValues": true,
        "rowHeight": 0.8,
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false
        }
      },
      "description": "Whether the last read probe succeeded; rfrs is a bootstrapping instance's replicas."
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Invariants",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 36,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "redis_soak_invariant_ok{rf=\"$rf\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{invariant}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "no",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "yes",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showValue": "never",
        "mergeValues": true,
        "rowHeight": 0.8,
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false
        }
      },
      "description": "Each invariant at the last check. A violation outside a window is a finding."
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Window, masters and failovers",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 36,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "redis_soak_window_open{rf=\"$rf\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "window open",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "redis_soak_masters{rf=\"$rf\"}",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "masters",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "increase(redis_soak_failovers_total{rf=\"$rf\"}[$__rate_interval])",
          "refId": "C",
          "legendFormat": "failovers",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "redis_soak_rf_healthy{rf=\"$rf\"}",
          "refId": "D",
          "legendFormat": "Healthy",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
